# SEO — {{ project_name }}

## On-page
- Unique title and meta description per public page
- One clear H1; logical heading hierarchy
- Descriptive alt text on meaningful images

## Technical
- Canonical URLs where duplicates exist
- Sitemap and robots.txt for production
- Core Web Vitals: monitor LCP, CLS, INP

## Content
- Write for humans first; keywords should read naturally
- Internal links between related pages
- Use structured data when it matches real page content

Run the `seo-audit` skill for substantive SEO reviews.
